Z||000015||Monkeyman||02-20-2000||05:43 AM||||You can't buy love.  What you can buy is a piece of butt for a while.  I agree that you can't make a life long commitment after only knowing someone 2 hours, but you don't necessarily have to know them for years, either.  I met my wife just a little over a month before we got married.(yup.  We met the beginning of Feb, 1998 and got married on the 7th or 8th of March same year)  Next month will be our 2nd wedding anniversary.  We have our little spats but nothing to get excited about.  I see many more years together!  One of the best things that's ever happened to me!||||reg||1
